#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-weight-engine.php
msgid "SM Weight Engine"
msgstr "SM Weight Engine"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-weight-engine.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-weight-engine.php
msgid ""
"Steel section catalogue (IPE, HEA, HEB, HEM, IPN, UPN, UPE, angles, tubes, "
"flats, bars, plates) with sourced and cross-checked reference data, exact "
"cross-section drawings and theoretical weight calculations (bars <-> total "
"weight). Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"Catalogue des profilés acier (IPE, HEA, HEB, HEM, IPN, UPN, UPE, cornières, "
"tubes, fers plats, barres, tôles) avec données de référence sourcées et "
"vérifiées, schémas de section exacts et calcul des poids théoriques (barres "
"↔ poids total). Nécessite SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
